{"unit_id":"summersummer-liu__dsh-su#card-zh","repo":"summersummer-liu/dsh-su","commit":"acf50fb3712eb6fa4c6c222b9142de0e641c7522","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-su 是面向桌面 DSH 的 SketchUp 建模桥接插件，可让 agent 连接本机运行的 SketchUp 会话。它注册状态检查、扩展安装、会话启动、Ruby 脚本与代码执行、模型保存、视口截图和退出等工具，并可注册 sketchup-modeling 技能。插件通过本机 TCP JSON 行协议调用随包提供的 SketchUp 扩展；建模工具箱支持公制几何、标签、材质和相机操作。适合用 DSH 自动创建、检查并交付 SketchUp 模型的用户。需要 Windows 环境、SketchUp 和 DSH；不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:275-335","index.js:337-582","index.js:587-591","sketchup/dsh_su_bridge/server.rb:175-209","sketchup/dsh_su_bridge/su_kit.rb:34-63"]}
{"unit_id":"summersummer-liu__dsh-su#card-en","repo":"summersummer-liu/dsh-su","commit":"acf50fb3712eb6fa4c6c222b9142de0e641c7522","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-su connects DSH to a local SketchUp session. It launches SketchUp, runs Ruby modeling scripts, inspects models, saves SKP files, and captures viewport images. Its metric kit provides geometry, tags, materials, and camera helpers. Requires Windows, SketchUp, and DSH; no API key needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:275-335","index.js:337-582","index.js:587-591","sketchup/dsh_su_bridge/server.rb:175-209","sketchup/dsh_su_bridge/su_kit.rb:34-63"]}
